ion of data. our will also comply with regulatory constraints such as GDPR, anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT), and auditor independence rules. our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring that all client data is stored and processed within the European Union, with no transfer outside the European Union. our technical architecture is based on our Atelier platform, which utilizes retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to provide accurate and reliable outputs. our will leverage our model-agnostic approach to select a suitable model option that meets Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' needs, ensuring strong grounding/citation behavior and preserving professional secrecy and reliability of figures. a tailored solution to address Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' requirements for an artificial intelligence assistance tool will also integrate with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' production tools, such as accounting-production software, payroll software, and document management systems (GED), through API-type interfaces. our are committed to delivering a high-quality solution that meets Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' expectations for quality and cost optimization. our budget allocation is €220,000 over 3 years, which is within our normal deal range and financial capacity. our will manage our costs efficiently while delivering a tailored solution that provides value for money. our model-agnostic approach involves corpus curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design, and an evaluation loop to ensure that a tailored solution to address Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' requirements for an artificial intelligence assistance tool meets Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' specific needs. our will work closely with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' experts to configure our retrieval and prompt systems, providing a clear understanding of how our system arrives at our system outputs. our also prioritize environmental sustainability and will assess the environmental impact of a tailored solution to address Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' requirements for an artificial intelligence assistance tool, reporting the deployment footprint to Cabinet Vauclair & Associés'. our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, uses renewable energy and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, reducing waste and minimizing environmental impact. our practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps reduce energy consumption. a tailored solution to address Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' requirements for an artificial intelligence assistance tool will be delivered progressively, with a pilot phase on one office or one mission line, followed by progressive generalization. our will provide change management support and training to facilitate a smooth transition." ;
