        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and quality of work while preserving professional secrecy and reliability of figures. an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and quality of work while preserving professional secrecy and reliability of figures must provide quick access to reliable information, support drafting professional documents, handle client files, and facilitate mission continuity between collaborators." ;
